+- `d_B`: `gudhi.bottleneck_distance(A,B,e=0.0)`; aggregate = `max(D0,D1)`.
+- `W_{2,∞}`: `wasserstein_distance(A,B,matching=False,order=2.0,internal_p=np.inf,keep_essential_parts=False)`; aggregate = `hypot(D0,D1)`.
